# vast_sdmonly_fleet11.list - the wave 11 fleet (lane FLEET10), rented 2026-10-03 (UTC). An explicit list, one line per box.
# Each box is 2x RTX 5090, image pytorch/pytorch:2.8.0-cuda12.8-cudnn9-runtime, disk 100 GB. Every offer passed the selector
# (--min-vram 30000 --disk 100) and its transfer veto ($15/TB). The deadline is 7 hours after the last box is ready; the pull
# loop track4_sdmonly_vast_watch_fleet11.sh destroys every box below by its id at that deadline.
