# 54033220 (h, image pull stalled), 54036755 (h again, machine 140737, stalled then stopped by the host; slot h left empty),
# 54033225 (i, machine 52491, network stalled: HF download stuck at 1.14 GB, box-to-box copy about 65 KB/s).
